<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταδήμιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the midst of</i> or <i>among the people</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τι κακὸν μεταδήμιον εἴη</span>
			no harm be <i>among the people</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.46
			</span></i>; <i>in the country</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἔθ᾽ Ἥφαιστος μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.293
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος μ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχώριος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				744
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
